      "how": "Halo CE's kit can't read tags programmatically. Export characters\\cyborg\\cyborg.gbxmodel to JMS with a community CE tag tool (e.g. Mozzarilla's model exporter) and save it as {cache}\\halo1\\cyborg\\model.jms. Put its textures beside it as <material>_base.tga."
    }
  },
  "pieces": [
